Package: sonicli
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, mpv, fzf, jq, socat, figlet, python3
Recommends: yt-dlp
Description: lightweight terminal music player for Linux and Termux
 SoniCLI provides an interactive terminal interface for searching and
 streaming audio using yt-dlp, fzf and mpv.
